# Zotero

## Easy BibTeX Export

-> Edit -> Settings -> Export

- Set Quick Copy Item Format to BibTeX
- Copy BibTeX with Ctrl + Shift + c

## Usefull features

- Move Items with Shift + Mouse-drag
- Export entire Library
	- While on library browser: -> File -> Export Library
		- zotero rdf is recommended
		- csv is smaller
		- no further tests done
	- Maybe check CLI availability?
